{
  "$schema": "evals/questions.schema — see evals/CLAUDE.md",
  "version": 1,
  "note": "Golden retrieval set. Every expectedChunkId is a real id in content/dist/content.json and run.mjs refuses to run if one is not. Questions with an empty expectedChunkIds are ABSTENTION questions: the correct behaviour is to retrieve nothing. They are split three ways — out-of-corpus (not in the corpus at all), structured-only (in content.json as a structured field, but not as a chunk, so only the tool layer can answer it), and corpus-gap (an entity that exists but produced no chunk).",
